  "description": "A flexible, pluggable logging library with a clean ILogger/ILogProvider abstraction used across the entire NextGen Software ecosystem (OASIS, HoloNET, STAR). Supports multiple simultaneous log providers -- console, file, NLog, and custom implementations. Configurable log levels, formatting, and async log dispatch. Part of the OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/NextGenSoftware-Libraries",
